SUMMARY:HOUSE MAJORITY RUNS THROUGH CALIFORNIA | Phone Banks!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261004T150000
UID:7fe1a1848836948bd7c94bc2136379e4@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/2026%20phone%20banks_20260301211237462813.png
DESCRIPTION:**In 2025\, California made history by passing Prop 50. Now it
 ’s time to turn that victory into lasting change by Taking Back the Hous
 e!** We're going to reach out to voters in our targeted districts early to
  hear their issues\, concerns and ideas. And we'll be using some of the be
 st practices from **Deep Canvassing** to have more engaged and meaningful 
 conversations. **Join our virtual phone banks with the Bay Area Coalition 
 and other California Democratic Party partners and help stop the Trump /
LOCATION:Virtual event
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/913758/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Yolo (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
